    "source": "<b>Ophelia:</b> <indent=16%>I agree. And I'd like to come to know you in all senses.</indent>\n<b>Ophelia:</b> <indent=16%>Why don't you show me what a King can do?</indent>\n<b>Claudius:</b> <indent=16%>Cheeky, cheeky girl.</indent>\n<b>Claudius:</b> <indent=16%>But I warn you, now that you're mine, you won't be going <i>anywhere</i> soon...",
